1
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,733
This tape concerns your Initiation.

2
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:23,100
Once initiated, things began to arrive.

3
00:00:23,167 --> 00:00:25,800
Four packs. About one a month.

4
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:29,100
Figure one. A letter. And your badge.

5
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,733
Figure two. The Antenna.

6
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:35,767
On a Console, it listens for one kind of signal.

7
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:38,700
Figure three. The Multiverse Console.

8
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,967
Your Multiverse Console.

9
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:43,533
Figure four. Sealed.

10
00:00:43,533 --> 00:00:46,667
Even this tape cannot say what is inside.

11
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:48,900
There are two ways in.

12
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,567
The Initial pack. The first two.

13
00:00:51,567 --> 00:00:53,800
The Complete pack. All four.

14
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,333
Either way, you are a Voyager.

15
00:00:57,033 --> 00:00:58,567
End of orientation.

16
00:00:59,033 --> 00:01:00,600
Stay on the frequency.
